{"id": "swebq0130", "pool": "swebq", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Well, Jimmy Hendrix's Purple Haze is a song about the experience of being under the influence of mind-alter ing substances. It' s often interpreted as describing the effects of drugs like LSD or other halluc inogenic substances on one's perception and consciousness. The lyrics mention colors, distortions, and altered states of awareness, which are commonly associated with psychedelic experiences. While the exact meaning might be open to interpretation, it's widely understood to capture the feeling of being disor iented and transformed by these kinds of experiences.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 26, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "swebq0138", "pool": "swebq", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Justin Bieber plays a few musical instruments. He's known for playing the guitar, which he often uses in his music and performance s. He also plays the piano and has shown interest in other instrument s like the drums or even the ukulele in some videos. While he' s not always seen performing with them live on stage, these are definitely part of his musical skill set.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 21, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "swebq0146", "pool": "swebq", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Daniel Craig has been in a lot of films, but he's best known for his role as James Bond. He played the character in five film s: Skyfall, Q uantum of Solace, S pectre, No Time to Die, and Casino Royale. Before that, he was also in movies like The World Is Not Enough, Layer Cake, and Munich. He ’s known for bringing a dark, intense energy to his roles, especially in Bond.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 25, "carrier_ended": null}
